  "details": "In the VRChat Home world, there is a Sign that states \"No One Can Hear you Talk?\"\n\nIt shows an Image Depiction of what I would believe to be the Correct Settings to use for Audio.\n\nHowever, there is a problem with the \"Mic Activation Threshold\" Selector, it shows in the Image at 100%, but that would make it so people on Quest/PC would have to Scream at their microphone to be audible else it will cut out so nobody can hear them, Regardless of having the proper Microphone selected.\n\nIt would be nice for Quality of Life Improvements for this image to Depict how the Mic Activation Threshold should be for Proper audio input on the Microphone (5%)",
